"Victor is Alden Thorn's orange, scarred, semi-feral tomcat."
"He hates carriers."
"He bit and scratched Alden's right hand."
"He is unafraid of Gorgon."
"While Alden was away he lived at Jeremy's, grew shockingly fat and got a collar with a bell."
"He has a bite out of one ear."
"By autumn he lives with Alden on Anesidora; Boe's escape skill used him as its host."
"In November he was teleported back to Jeremy in Chicago, carrying Boe in catspace."
"In the Matadero crisis wizards penned him in a magic dome, then sent him back to Chicago."
"After that he is no longer the return point for Boe's U-type skill."
